#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:1
#: c0105ce8528b4873a4afb6c67699f51b
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop"
msgstr "同构遥操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:3
#: f048389acd534be8a4d024ee7858657e
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作) for HT Panthera dual-arm: move "
"the master arm in joint space and the slave follows."
msgstr "面向 HT Panthera 双臂的主从 **同构遥操作**：在关节空间移动主臂，从臂跟随。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:5
#: 05afe7fbe6ec43b087f1516f1600f8e0
msgid ""
"This is **not** drag teaching. There is no trajectory record/playback and no"
" `enter_teach_mode` API. The implemented path is the public package "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)."
msgstr ""
"这 **不是** 拖动示教。没有轨迹录制/回放，也没有 `enter_teach_mode` API。已实现路径是公开软件包 "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:7
#: 0f1e15b36fe546518abe224e8b159456
msgid ""
"**README:** [drag_teleop_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller/blob/main/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"**README：** [drag_teleop_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller/blob/main/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:9
#: 7312cfaa77b54f938f1c6ccf9cc79be9
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置条件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:11
#: 1000b8676dc74c1dbbf9c09b4299b001
msgid "Workspace that includes `drag_teleop_controller` (public)"
msgstr "工作空间已包含 `drag_teleop_controller`（公开）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:12
#: 5a01b6813390413fbaab89d2e2d9a17b
msgid "HT Panthera description (`panthera_ht` / `ht_panthera`)"
msgstr "HT Panthera 描述（`panthera_ht` / `ht_panthera`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:13
#: ba4da35f613445599fb2e02d523e9291
msgid ""
"Two launch processes: one `master`, one `slave` (mock or two physical arms)"
msgstr "两个启动进程：一个 `master`、一个 `slave`（mock 或两台实体臂）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:15
#: 21c2276aa7a94cada3aa892ee4da09a9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:17
#: b20c058f5411475baeefa9db5b419852
msgid "One controller plugin, two roles:"
msgstr "同一个控制器插件，两种角色："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 60d1e7fc80ea42d59e762ab2cb359d43
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: b59e413669924923b492e238b6891304
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: ab00a4a6189e4d398d144a43b1ea2b58
msgid "`master`"
msgstr "`master`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: d79a6e2a1319443fa40a0e884695428c
msgid ""
"Operator side. Gravity compensation so you can move the arm; publishes "
"mapped joint state."
msgstr "操作者侧。重力补偿以便拖动主臂；发布映射后的关节状态。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: adf766f6c59749468a42a90ea2dda7df
msgid "`slave`"
msgstr "`slave`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 4fa38431e0b5486cbfb2963f0c74c3b3
msgid "Follower. Tracks the mapped master joints (optional ruckig smoothing)."
msgstr "从臂。跟踪映射后的主臂关节（可选 ruckig 平滑）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:24
#: 1b5c0bdb9b7c4e84851fd44f09c53678
msgid ""
"Control modes (`mode`): `position` (slave only), `mit`, `effort`. Master-"
"only force feedback (`feedback`): `false`, `position`, `effort`. Joint "
"mapping runs before `teleop_states` is published. Grippers are handled by "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller` (spawned from the same launch)."
msgstr ""
"控制模式（`mode`）：`position`（仅从臂）、`mit`、`effort`。仅主臂的力反馈（`feedback`）：`false`、`position`、`effort`。关节映射在发布"
" `teleop_states` 之前完成。夹爪由同一 launch 拉起的 `adaptive_gripper_controller` 控制。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:26
#: 2c22ffb57d8f416dae4b06e8152faf52
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "准备"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:28
#: bcfd44d3b7fe4787bd5153bd49feec36
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-select drag_teleop_controller --symlink-install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-select drag_teleop_controller --symlink-install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:34
#: 430779197f21425698cb86e8dc3b450c
msgid "Mock (no hardware)"
msgstr "Mock（无需硬件）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:36
#: b83b447cc4d24b69b7841325c8394e05
msgid "Two terminals:"
msgstr "两个终端："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:38
#: 10b949dadf8648338ff89727956a368b
msgid ""
"# Terminal 1 — master\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Terminal 2 — slave\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
msgstr ""
"# Terminal 1 — master\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Terminal 2 — slave\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:48
#: 959b5e0659864ced81b074c4c525b1eb
msgid "Check controllers and topics:"
msgstr "检查控制器与话题："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:50
#: a2cb2fc02ec74764b41cb903f06b47a8
msgid ""
"ros2 control list_controllers --controller-manager /drag_teleop_master/controller_manager\n"
"# drag_teleop_controller / left_gripper_controller / right_gripper_controller should be active\n"
"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_master/teleop_states\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_slave/teleop_states\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 control list_controllers --controller-manager /drag_teleop_master/controller_manager\n"
"# drag_teleop_controller / left_gripper_controller / right_gripper_controller should be active\n"
"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_master/teleop_states\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_slave/teleop_states\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:58
#: 930d658c25894715a908854facada5ea
msgid "Real hardware (HT Panthera)"
msgstr "真机（HT Panthera）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:60
#: a9773e31c4a045b58d62126fc30f7fd3
msgid ""
"Launch file and argument names below match the package README. Default "
"`robot` is `panthera_ht`. Use `hardware:=real` (or `real_usb`)."
msgstr ""
"下列 launch 文件与参数名与软件包 README 一致。默认 `robot` 为 `panthera_ht`。真机用 "
"`hardware:=real`（或 `real_usb`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:62
#: 3ee11d29bbc6467285a64c58f9672b76
msgid ""
"# Master (low-stiffness, gravity-compensated)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_gripper_kp:=\"1e-5\" hardware_gripper_kd:=\"1e-5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Slave (MIT follow)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"
msgstr ""
"# Master (low-stiffness, gravity-compensated)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_gripper_kp:=\"1e-5\" hardware_gripper_kd:=\"1e-5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Slave (MIT follow)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:74
#: 9cc0d3b1f4154b93b60d67cdd0d60a9f
msgid ""
"Optional master with external-effort feedback: add `feedback:=effort` (see "
"README)."
msgstr "可选：主臂加外部力矩反馈，增加 `feedback:=effort`（见 README）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:76
#: 054d9bc99ea344e0886555eddfb1c055
msgid "Mode switching"
msgstr "模式切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:78
#: a449ba43ff2c4145953e219e6376414d
msgid "Custom services, not `std_srvs/Trigger`:"
msgstr "自定义服务，不是 `std_srvs/Trigger`："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:80
#: 0d962147e6924097980c658986aa16c8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_mode \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopMode \"{mode: effort}\"\n"
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_feedback \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopFeedback \"{mode: position}\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_mode \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopMode \"{mode: effort}\"\n"
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_feedback \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopFeedback \"{mode: position}\"\n"

