msgid ""
"DexCap glove → robot mapping is a **different** package: [teleop-joint-"
"mapper](../4-reference/teleop/4-teleop_joint_mapper.md). It is not this "
"master–slave isomorphic path."
msgstr ""
"DexCap 手套到机器人的映射是 **另一个** 软件包：[teleop-joint-"
"mapper](../4-reference/teleop/4-teleop_joint_mapper.md)。不是这条主从同构路径。"

